OL,3,GNEWSABritish surfer first to win big
OL,4,Awave award
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornish surfer Tom Lowe has become the
OL,7,Ffirst Briton to win Surfer of the Year
OL,8,Fat the international Big Wave Challenge
OL,9,Fawards after recovering from a
OL,10,Fnear-fatal accident.
OL,12,FThe award was presented at a ceremony
OL,13,Fin Los Angeles just over a year since
OL,14,Fhe suffered severe head trauma during a
OL,15,Fwipeout at Teahupo'o in Tahiti.
OL,17,FLowe, 42, who is originally from St
OL,18,FIves, was also nominated for ride of
OL,19,Fthe year for a wave he surfed at
OL,20,FMullaghmore in Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
