OL,3,GNEWSABritish surfer first to win big
OL,4,Awave award
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This one's for all the kids out there
OL,7,Fwho've come from nothing, nowhere,
OL,8,Fskint, struggling at school, everyone
OL,9,Fsaying you've got no chance," he said
OL,10,Fafter the awards.
